    "description": "Bloomberg uncovers the context behind the story, delivering business and markets news, data, analysis, and video to the world.\r\n\r\nKey Features Include:\r\n\u2022 Livestream of Bloomberg TV and Bloomberg Originals\r\n\u2022 Bloomberg TV shows such as: Bloomberg: The China Show, Bloomberg Surveillance, Wall Street Week, Bloomberg Technology and more\r\n\u2022 Bloomberg Originals shows such as: An Optimist's Guide To The Planet, The Deal, The Circuit with Emily Chang, The Future with Hannah Fry and more\r\n\r\nWe would love to hear from you. For any questions or comments please contact us at: https://www.bloomberg.com/feedback\r\n\r\nTerms of Use: https://www.bloomberg.com/notices/tos/",
